flowchart TD
  Start([Ingenieur startet Analyse]) --> Connect[ECU verbinden<br/>Sim / CAN / DoIP]
  Connect --> GMode{Transport?}
  GMode -->|simulation| Sim[Simulation Mode]
  GMode -->|UDS/DoIP| Uds[UDS Session<br/>0x10 / TesterPresent]
  GMode -->|OBD-II| Obd[OBD-II Lab<br/>PIDs / Mode 03/09]
  Sim --> ReadDtc[DTCs lesen<br/>0x19 / OBD]
  Uds --> ReadDtc
  Obd --> ReadDtc
  ReadDtc --> Enrich[Anreichern<br/>J2012 / ODX / Triage]
  Enrich --> Health[Vehicle Health + Timeline]
  Health --> GLlm{LLM Analyse?}
  GLlm -->|ja| Llm[LLM Assist<br/>opt-in]
  GLlm -->|nein| GTicket
  Llm --> GTicket{Ticket erstellen?}
  GTicket -->|ja| Alm[Jira / CodeBeamer]
  GTicket -->|nein| Export
  Alm --> Export[Export Report<br/>JSON / Confluence]
  Export --> End([Analyse abgeschlossen])
